# Settings baked into every production build (`npm run build`). Public values only: they end up in the
# JavaScript every visitor downloads, so never put a secret here.
#
# A production build refuses to run with anything else (vite.config.ts, scripts/build-safety.mjs). Variables
# already set in the environment still win over this file, which is why the build checks the final values.
# Demo build: `npm run build:demo` (.env.demo). Build against your own backend: `npm run build:local` (.env.local).
VITE_USE_API=true
VITE_API_URL=https://api.facecloudai.com
